        {
          "body": "[P2] Preserve three-argument verifier calls without a CA pin\n\nThis call always passes a fourth argument, even when no CA bundle is configured. Existing injected `PermitVerifier` implementations that still accept the previous three-argument interface therefore raise `TypeError` during ordinary system-default captures, before the lease is consumed. Keep the old call shape when `ca_bundle_sha256` is `None`, or provide an explicit compatibility path.",
          "commit_id": "530155c0762d485e710955995a44381a8f8f112e",
