        {
          "body": "Fixed in 10d44dc. System-default trust keeps the existing three-argument permit-verifier call; explicit CA trust supplies the fourth digest argument. The qualification binding now defaults its optional CA identity to None. A regression exercises the original verifier signature through capture and confirms one lease claim. Validation: 76 combined capture/resource/acquisition tests passed with no skips, including real TLS trust and hostname checks; Ruff and diff checks passed.",
          "commit_id": "530155c0762d485e710955995a44381a8f8f112e",
